{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1292615-novas-in-politics","id":1292615,"title":"Novas in Politics","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-27T15:04:26-08:00","id":1292615,"title":"Novas in Politics","content":"Just sayin, imagine if there were novas in Congress. Imagine how things would be with them. <br /> <br /> I know the book is a looooong way from coming out but I can't help but think of the various events that would come about with them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-27T15:42:18-08:00","id":1292630,"title":"","content":"I don\u2019t remamber for sure, but I think the first Nova Politician was the Fireman, at least on America as a country. For sure there was several local politicians that were novas, the Mega Social mainly, but the position as a Nova is a great deal...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-27T17:10:25-08:00","id":1292647,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1292615-novas-in-politics?p=1292630#post1292630\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don\u2019t remamber for sure, but I think the first Nova Politician was the Fireman, at least on America as a country. For sure there was several local politicians that were novas, the Mega Social mainly, but the position as a Nova is a great deal...</div> </div> </div> </div>In 1E Russia\u2019s Minister of Finance erupted. It eventually became widely recognized that the baseline President and most of the government became his puppets without him making any changes in titles.<br /> <br /> When Portman runs for President of the US, one of \u201cword on the streets\u201d quotes in Worldwide Phase 1 was an interviewee responding to the idea of a Nova President with the joke \u201cwhy not, Russia has one!\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-28T05:31:35-08:00","id":1292738,"title":"","content":"There's that WIld Cards story that features a politician. Can't remember the details off the top of my head.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8890-nullapostle","name":"NullApostle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-28T13:01:58-08:00","id":1292836,"title":"","content":"This is what always complicated lawmaking in the Aeon History for me, I expected Novas sometimes become politicians, so they would be involved in legislation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-28T13:39:20-08:00","id":1292846,"title":"","content":"While it seems like one of the points they let drop in the original line, the presence of nova politicians and lawmakers is precisely what the Directive was trying to avoid at any cost. Any such a being would be considered a &quot;threat to humankind&quot; as per their metric. The Newsman, their example of nova political meddling, was attempting to reformat Germany with his mega social stats that he managed to transmit through print and radio (i think). After him (and after Portman) they'd do their best to dissolve any other possible nova politicians.<br /> <br /> In our actual world, a nova politician would sweep into power like a memetic disease and only be properly checked by another, opposing nova politician. Butt-hurt &amp; over-privileged humans, terrified conspiracy theorist humans, and eventually indolent normal humans wouldn't stand for that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-28T13:49:24-08:00","id":1292850,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s even worse if you think that there were people with active M-R nodes (if I am not wrong Devires owner is one example) that didn\u2019t show any sign of quantum activity, and some were High quantum neutrals. You can say there were novas with subtle powers or that were turned their Nova Points on skills and attributes, pretending to be inactive Novas or high quantum neutrals.<br /> <br /> A person like this could operate as a neutral and work on politics, with... how can I say, high efficiency.<br /> There were also some Psiads, and just a few dots on Telepathy can give you huge advantages in politics, and didn\u2019t show up on any quantum scan.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 02-28-2019, 04:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-01T09:33:55-08:00","id":1293063,"title":"","content":"And that would trigger a whole new, even colder, war with a whole new level of &quot;big brother&quot; watching us. As that scenario describes one where it's not even obvious where a nova could be and EVERYONE has to be checked, double-checked, and followed <i>just in case</i>. Psiads added to the mix would stay secret for all of a year or two before &quot;novas that don't show up in q-scans&quot; get dissected in the situation room and on the media.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-01T09:59:29-08:00","id":1293070,"title":"","content":"When it begins, and before too many laws are written, nothing stops a nocarunning for Congress. Especially as 2018 is when it happens and there is an election. <br /> <br /> Heck. There might be chance for an already seated governmebt official to erupt. Imagine someobe giving a speech and as they speak they erupt as a nova with charisma and social ability. <br /> <br /> To me thete are four ways to go about it, well five really but that is banning them. The first is baseline human dominance and nova submission. The second is integration and equality. The third is nova dominance and baseline submission. The fourth is parallel systems, one for novas and one for baselines. <br /> <br /> At first though i think integration is the answee though later on i think the best is parallel law systems. <br /> <br /> Unless you eatto go the Exalted route with novas ruling like Solar Exalted. <br /> <br /> As a note, I xant hwlp but think of the Aes Sedai of the Second Age of the Wheel of Time series. The channelers had a sort of parallel cultural and legal status. One that took into consideration what they could do. But it was one that also gave checks and balances to them. <br /> <br /> All I know is that if bad things are happening abd I, as a nova, have the ability to something about it, well then I'm going to act.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}